Personal Arabic edition modifications (2026-10-13)
This is a modified personal build, not an official release from the ArtCraft Team.
Changes add Arabic interface and display-time diagnostic translations, child language selection
from Creative Suite Launcher, and local egui/epaint Unicode bidirectional layout, caret,
selection and shaping improvements. Source engine messages and document identifiers remain
canonical. Arabic uses ordinary Noto Sans Arabic; optional operating-system fonts are read at
runtime only and are not bundled. ArtCraft graphical branding is removed from the modified UI.
Original copyright, licenses and third-party attribution remain applicable. Local egui/epaint
sources retain MIT and Apache-2.0 licenses; the bundled font notices are in licenses/.

Independent Arabic/English edition modification notice — 2026-10-13
Prepared and maintained by mahmoud0al-haddad (إعداد وصيانة النسخة العربية).
Original upstream authors retain their copyrights; this is not an official or endorsed ArtCraft release.
Local changes include Arabic interface catalogs, display-time diagnostics, selectable launcher language, and ordinary Arabic UI font support.
The amended egui/epaint0.36.2 sources add Arabic shaping/bidi and logical editing/selection mappings; their MIT and Apache-2.0 notices remain in vendor/.
Optional embedded Noto Sans Arabic is from the pinned craft-fonts input under SIL OFL1.1; its authors, source checksum and OFL text remain with build-inputs/craft-fonts.
Installed Tahoma may be read at runtime but no proprietary system font file is distributed. ArtCraft graphical marks are excluded; original brand terms and factual upstream credit are retained.
